  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a9c3631d-0fd9-4c02-9acd-ffc22b12790f.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"426\" height=\"240\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_16063ff8-491b-4009-9fa9-59e5c01050ed.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"426\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p>Dolphin Dive 完全还原《使命召唤》中的动作，允许玩家快速向前跃出并砸向地面，以便在战斗中进行快速位移。</p>\n<p>必需：<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TACZ</a></span></p>\n<p>疾跑时按下 C 键发动 Dive</p>\n<p>强烈推荐：<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">PlayerAnimator（更佳的动画效果）</a></span></p>\n<p>必需：<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth_config</a></span></p>\n<p>使用与权限<br>您可以将本模组用于视频和直播中。 &nbsp;<br>请在描述中注明作者。</p>\n<p>您不得：<br>- 出售本模组<br>- 重新上传<br>- 修改或重新分发</p>",
